  (text "WIRELESS COMMUNICATIONS\n\n1. LoRa (SX1276/RFM95W):\n   - SPI1 interface, 868/915MHz\n   - +20dBm TX, -148dBm sensitivity\n   - SMA antenna connector\n   - Range: up to 15km LOS\n\n2. BLE + WiFi (ESP32-C3-MINI-1):\n   - WiFi 802.11 b/g/n (2.4GHz)\n   - Bluetooth 5.0 LE\n   - UART7 for AT commands\n   - u.FL antenna connector\n\n3. GSM/LTE (SIM7600G-H):\n   - LTE Cat-1 global bands\n   - 2G/3G fallback\n   - UART4 interface, AT commands\n   - Nano SIM push-push holder\n   - SMA connectors (Main + GNSS)\n   - Dedicated 4.1V LDO, 100uF bulk caps"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
